@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@ticketId = VRP-01234567
@ticketToken = paste-the-player-access-code-here
@adminToken = replace-with-Support__AdminToken

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Create a player ticket (copy ticketId and accessCode from the response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Beispielspieler",
  "contact": "Discord: beispiel",
  "category": "Launcher",
  "subject": "Launcher startet nicht",
  "message": "Beim Starten erscheint eine Fehlermeldung. Ich habe bereits einen Neustart versucht."
}

### Read the player ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
X-Ticket-Token: {{ticketToken}}

### Player follow-up
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
X-Ticket-Token: {{ticketToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Ich habe die Fehlermeldung jetzt als Screenshot."
}

### List all tickets as support
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Read one ticket as support
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reply as support
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets/{{ticketId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Danke für die Meldung. Bitte installiere den Launcher erneut und gib uns Bescheid."
}

### Update ticket status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}
